      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I saw an apple falling of a tree the other day, and it gave me an idea. What if I used a spell to enhance the gravity of that apple? Maybe that's thinking too small. What if I could "
        },
        {
          "text": "increase gravity on my target",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " in general?\n\nThey would hit the ground harder when they fall, and it could probably force some flying targets to the ground."
        }
      ]
    }
